<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<testsuites><testsuite name="Invoices &lt;Q3&gt; &amp; &#34;Ops&#34;" tests="8" failures="2" errors="0" time="1.234" timestamp="2026-10-08T09:30:00Z"><testcase classname="Invoices &lt;Q3&gt; &amp; &#34;Ops&#34;" name="[file-op-no-error-handler] File operation without error handler @file-op-no-e" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="File operation without error handler">This file/folder operation can fail due to missing files, permission issues, or file locks but has no error handler.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in an &#39;On Block Error&#39; handler to manage missing files, permission errors, and file lock issues gracefully.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="Invoices &lt;Q3&gt; &amp; &#34;Ops&#34;" name="[hardcoded-credential] Credential variable set to literal value @hardcoded-cr" time="0"><failure type="error" message="Credential variable set to literal value">Variable &#39;Password&#39; has a name that suggests it holds a credential and is assigned a literal string value.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Store credentials in a secured vault, Windows Credential Manager, or use a PAD input variable instead of a literal string in the flow.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="Invoices &lt;Q3&gt; &amp; &#34;Ops&#34;" name="[hardcoded-filepath] Hardcoded file path @hardcoded-fi" time="0"><system-out>Property &#39;File&#39; contains an absolute path: C:\data\in.txt&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Use a relative path or store the base directory in a variable configured per environment.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="Invoices &lt;Q3&gt; &amp; &#34;Ops&#34;" name="[subflow-no-error-handler] Subflow without error handler @subflow-no-e" time="0"><system-out>Subflow &#34;Main&#34; has action blocks but no error handler. Unhandled errors will silently terminate the subflow.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Add a Try/Catch or On Block Error handler to protect against unexpected failures.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="Invoices &lt;Q3&gt; &amp; &#34;Ops&#34;" name="[todo-in-comment] TODO in comment @todo-in-comm" time="0"><system-out>This comment contains a TODO marker: &#34;TODO: remove the =SUM(A1) hack&#34;&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Resolve the TODO or convert it to a tracked issue.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="Invoices &lt;Q3&gt; &amp; &#34;Ops&#34;" name="[unused-variable] Variable declared but never used @unused-varia" time="0"><system-out>This variable is set but never referenced elsewhere in the flow.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Remove the unused variable or add a reference to it.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="Invoices &lt;Q3&gt; &amp; &#34;Ops&#34;" name="[unused-variable] Variable declared but never used @unused-varia" time="0"><system-out>This variable is set but never referenced elsewhere in the flow.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Remove the unused variable or add a reference to it.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="Invoices &lt;Q3&gt; &amp; &#34;Ops&#34;" name="[wait-zero] Wait zero @wait-zero:34" time="0"><system-out>This WAIT action has a duration of 0, making it a no-op.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Remove the WAIT 0 action or increase the duration.</system-out></testcase></testsuite></testsuites>